      "title": "netscaler: slight code cleanup.",
      "message": "netscaler: slight code cleanup.\n\nThere's a section of nstrace_dump() that tests the file version and,\nregardless of the version, calls the same two routines in the same\nfashion.  Those routines also check the file version and do different\nthings; if the version is something unexpected, they fail, so the check\nfor a sane version in nstrace_dump() is unnecessary.\n\nJust call those routines without checking the version.\n",
